"the end of a word<br><br>The following repetition operators exist:<br><b>?</"
"b> - The preceding item is matched at most once<br><b>*</b> - The preceding "
"item is matched zero or more times<br><b>+</b> - The preceding item is "
"matched one or more times<br><b>{<i>n</i>}</b> - The preceding item is "
"matched exactly <i>n</i> times<br><b>{<i>n</i>,}</b> - The preceding item is "
"matched <i>n</i> or more times<br><b>{,<i>n</i>}</b> - The preceding item is "
"matched at most <i>n</i> times<br><b>{<i>n</i>,<i>m</i>}</b> - The preceding "
"item is matched at least <i>n</i>,<br>   but at most <i>m</i> times."
